"quote":"薛综字敬文，沛郡竹邑人也〖1〗。﹝一﹞少依族人避地交州，从刘熙学。士燮既附孙权，召综为五官中郎〔将〕。除合浦、交阯太守。时交土始开，刺史吕岱率师讨伐，综与俱行。越海南征，及到九真。事毕还都，守谒者仆射〖2〗。","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":104},{"id":"zhangyan-q-d7503dd43194a49833bd","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-3cb1d4864b2f127e69a3","layer":"original","quote":"程秉字德枢，汝南南顿人也〖1〗。逮事郑玄〖2〗。后避乱交州，与刘熙考论大义〖3〗：遂博通五经。士燮命为长史。","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":100,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54},{"id":"zhangyan-q-eece867346c9804f5947","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-2fffc7b23749864d70a6","layer":"original","quote":"少依族人避地交州，从刘熙学","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":19,"end":32},{"id":"zhangyan-q-f4860c5be866bb299911","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-3cb1d4864b2f127e69a3","layer":"original","quote":"后避乱交州，与刘熙考论大义〖3〗：遂博通五经","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":100,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":24,"end":46}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
